OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a mostly cloudy day
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of light rain. Still
OL,7,Fsome good dry spells and perhaps some
OL,8,Fbrighter intervals breaking through.
OL,9,FLight winds becoming westerly and
OL,10,Fstrengthening later, especially across
OL,11,FOuter Hebrides.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FMostly cloudy with a few
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain but clearer
OL,15,Fintervals developing in the evening.
OL,16,FOvernight there may be a few showers,
OL,17,Fwith clear intervals between
OL,18,Fthem.Winds easing. Rather cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
