OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FVariable cloud with some
OL,6,Fbright or sunny spells. A few showers
OL,7,Fpossible, these mainly in the west
OL,8,Fwhere they may be heavy, with longer
OL,9,Fdry spells in the east.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fand breezy with heavy rain clearing to
OL,13,Fthe north through Friday. Further
OL,14,Fspells of heavy rain over the weekend
OL,15,Fwith winds strengthening and bringing
OL,16,Fa risk of gales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
